<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Repair Ingredients Are All You Need: Improving Large Language Model-Based Program Repair via Repair Ingredients Search</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX">XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>the 48th International Conference on Software Engineering; 12–18 April, 2026; Rio de Janeiro, Brazil</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Software and its engineering Software testing and debugging</span></span></span>
